  "releaseNotes": "'## [10.1.0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v10.0.4...v10.1.0) (2026-01-06)\n\n### Features\n\n* **cli:** add --no-ansi option to CLI commands for disabling ANSI output ([#1018](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1018)) ([57bfa9b](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/57bfa9b98f5b3d1d14bbb7cdfd822ad2c6e302a2)), closes [#1010](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1010)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **cli:** fall back to local KubeOps CLI ([#1020](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1020)) ([bb5ca48](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/bb5ca4842de85737b08cc0cf9a5ca4f580f07ef1)), closes [#1009](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1009)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **core:** update dependency jsonpatch.net to 4.0.1 ([#1024](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1024)) ([ac7b9a2](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/ac7b9a237c00c1a004bc02974e26262e5cb854f8)), closes [#1021](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1021)\n'",
